WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.998
Your Level 1 learners need their own page for every lesson,

00:00:03.998 --> 00:00:07.337
and copying worksheets together each week takes hours.

00:00:08.354 --> 00:00:11.266
63 printable A4 pages.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:17.315
It's for children aged 4 to 8 doing Level 1 with a teacher, tutor or parent.

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:20.764
190,000 dong per learner.

00:00:20.764 --> 00:00:23.864
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

